<p>You speak a chosen prophecy to the masses. When applying this prophecy, it will spread to all targets in radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 1, 1, 2, 2.</acronym></p><p>A prophecy can only be affected by one of Grand Oration, Twofold Curse or Revelation.</p><p></p><p>Current prophecy: None</p>